        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Concept Art, Then a Moving Version\n\nGenerates a concept frame, then animates it into a short clip. Settling the still first is cheaper, because a video call costs many times an image.\n\n**How it works:** Type the idea into \"1 Concept\". \"2 Concept frame\" renders a 16:9 image at 1K. \"3 Animate it\" turns that image into a 4-second 720p clip with a slow push in. \"4 Clip\" shows the video.\n\n**Try this:** Pick models on both generation nodes, and change the prompt on \"3 Animate it\" to a different camera move, such as a slow pan right."
        },
